WEBVTT

00:01:28.530 --> 00:01:31.730
to produce a more
racially egalitarian society.

00:01:32.363 --> 00:01:33.863
We like to hunt for races

00:01:33.863 --> 00:01:38.997
and distance ourselves from people who say
mean things about whole groups of people

00:01:39.030 --> 00:01:41.697
or who idealize the 1950s.

00:01:41.730 --> 00:01:45.663
But the fact of the matter is that
we might just need to look in the mirror.

00:01:46.430 --> 00:01:49.397
Now, I'm not saying
that everyone here is a racist,

00:01:49.430 --> 00:01:53.497
but what I am saying
is that everyone here has the capacity

00:01:53.530 --> 00:01:55.497
and perhaps even the propensity

00:01:55.530 --> 00:01:57.363
to live their life in a way,

00:01:57.397 --> 00:01:58.697
to make decisions,

00:01:58.730 --> 00:02:00.830
to rely on biases